Package: conditionalgraphicalcox
Title: Conditional Graphical Models for Multivariate Cox Processes
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Jasen", "Zhang", email = "jasenzhang@g.ucla.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Code for the simulation study (Section 5) and the mouse spike-train
    analysis (Section 6) of the manuscript. Not an installable package: this file
    only records the R dependencies (see README.md and renv.lock).
